pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 需求四｜安全审计与插件扩展边界
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 在扩展审计能力的同时，确保来源、方法、路径、凭证和原始数据均处于受控边界。
  - elementId: c1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>业务需求</strong></p>
        <p>企业审计能力以插件形态独立演进，不改变核心管理面板的稳定性。</p>
        <p>页面复用宿主认证能力。</p>
  - elementId: c2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [355, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$red"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [373, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "$white"
      text: |
        <p><strong>安全边界</strong></p>
        <p>校验 iframe origin、HTTP method、插件路径与资源 allowlist。</p>
        <p>管理凭证不进入插件页面。</p>
  - elementId: c3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [650, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: c3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [668, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>数据要求</strong></p>
        <p>分析明细仅提供掩码、Hash 和非秘密 metadata，不暴露 raw_json 与明文 Key。</p>
  - elementId: flow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 380, 840, 58]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: 审计需求 → 插件契约 → 来源与路径校验 → 数据脱敏 → 独立交付
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 474, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 相关功能：Enterprise Access Audit、插件资源管理、iframe 通信和 Analytics 安全展示。
